<title>SOUTH AFRICA: G F Prop issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>G F Prop issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Fields Property Company Ltd advised on Wednesday that shareholders should continue to exercise caution in dealing in the shares of the company.</p>
<p>It referred to cautionary announcements on January 29 and February 19 but gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
